# Repository Structure

## Purpose

Documents the **current canonical** layout and **backend migration state** (2026-08-28). Quality reference: **lead-intent-processor** (`internal/app` ~18 prod `.go` wires; logic in `crm/`, `ingest/`, `filter/`, `sink/`). Do not refactor toward the target tree without an explicit milestone slug (`deploy/vendor/modular_structure_backlog.md`).

